cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HARVEST-X, please cite it as below."
title: "HARVEST-X: An Open Research Platform for Autonomous Lettuce Harvesting in Controlled-Environment Agriculture"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shrestha
    given-names: Rupesh
repository-code: "https://github.com/shrestharupeshh/harvest-x"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-15
keywords:
  - agricultural robotics
  - controlled-environment agriculture
  - lettuce harvesting
  - RGB-D perception
  - end effector
abstract: >-
  Work-in-progress open-source platform (software, hardware designs, simulation and
  experimental protocols) for robotic harvesting of hydroponic lettuce. As of v0.2.0 the
  perception library with a synthetic-data benchmark, first-iteration end-effector CAD and
  analytical sizing calculations exist; no hardware has been built and no physical
  experiment has been performed.
